  "notes": [
    "Gold rows are the five championship events: the Showdown Cup, SuperVol, Open, Main Event and Grand Freeze. Day 2 and Day 3 rows are qualifiers only; the Main Event, Cup and Open flights allow up to three entries, the SuperVol unlimited.",
    "Buy-in shown as total, then entry + staff and house fee: $30 on buy-ins up to $220, $40 on $250, $45 on $300, $50 on $350, $60 on $400, $70 on $450, $100 on $750 and $200 on $1,500.",
    "Three warm-up satellites on 28–30 September each award four $3,100 packages into the Cup, Open, SuperVol and Main Event. Nightly satellites pay one seat in ten; Main Event satellites pay one in five.",
    "Tournament directors are TDA certified and rules of play follow the TDA. Players must be 18 or over and Aurum Poker Grand members. Schedule subject to change; events may run into a Day 2 or Day 3 depending on numbers.",
    "The PDF prints Showdown Open flights 1C–1F and Day 2 as Event 1; they are Event 7 and are recorded so.",
    "The $375 Xtreme Bounty has no entry in the fee table, so entry and fee are null for it."
